  "details": "Every night, at around 12:30 AM (EST), any and all Udon Video Players stop playing links from YouTube, instead showing the \"Unable To Load Video\" error.\n\nThis issue lasts for roughly 1.5 hours, with the only other functioning links being ones from Discord, Twitter, and any other supported website.\n\nThis is not an isolated issue either, as it affects me, and several of my other friends at the same time - all of which are on different platforms.",
